silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_04_engine_spans_concrete_anchor#dataengine silm:hasLongDescription "The DataEngine is the Mittens body-mass observation record from the May 2026 vet visit at Tartu Animal Clinic, entering the engine as a typed quality-claim source packet. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{DataEngine} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
