silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_04_engine_spans_concrete_anchor#executiontask silm:hasLongDescription "The ExecutionTask is the ShapeGate that validates the body-mass measurement schema (kg, range 2-12) before admission to the task node. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{ExecutionTask} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
