silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_04_engine_spans_concrete_anchor#executiontrace silm:hasLongDescription "The ExecutionTrace is the TaskNode that records the admitted body-mass measurement as the engine's executable transformation. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{ExecutionTrace}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_04_engine_spans_concrete_anchor#musicnode_9 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
